WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.900
A lecture video talks.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.200
A FrameTrail lesson asks back.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.400
Ask at the moment it matters.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Every answer has its own consequence: carry on, pause, jump to a time, open another film, show a link.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.900
That was a real quiz. What an answer does is one line of data.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.300
Beside the film, everything stays in step.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.800
That transcript is real. Click any line.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:31.200
26 kinds of content you can place in time.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.700
And learners can write back.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.600
Every learner annotates on their own timeline.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.600
Annotated lectures. Flipped classrooms. Open courseware.
